   "tender": {
    "id": "tender_420278/1357667",
    "title": "Cyber Security of AI Standards Consultancy Support",
    "description": "DSIT requires a supplier with expertise in leading the development of global standards within SDOs to support the delivery of a standard on the cyber security of AI within ETSI TC SAI. This will include:  \r\n\r\nTechnical drafting for the standard  \r\n\r\nRegistration and attendance at TC SAI meetings and related events \r\n\r\nStakeholder engagement throughout the development of the standard \r\n\r\nThese activities will require the supplier to be a credible technical expert within SDOs with expertise in cyber security and AI systems. The supplier will need to be active member of SDOs, and have a working level understanding of relevant work being undertaken across the standards landscape.",
